 # How to remove an image:
 must :
      1- list images and containers with :
     
         > docker ps -a 
         
       2- then stop the container using it ID   
       
          > docker stop 65840c555c16(ID)
          
        3- Remove the container first
        
           > docker rm 65840c555c16

        4- then delete the image 
         > docker rmi <image_name>
         > docker rmi hello-world:latest       


